WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:14.313
The fox led Jemima to his shed.

2
00:00:14.314 --> 00:00:17.779
Jemima looked inside.

3
00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:21.206
"Hmm," said Jemima.

4
00:00:21.207 --> 00:00:25.549
"Why are there so many feathers in there?"

5
00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:30.053
The fox didn't answer.

6
00:00:30.054 --> 00:00:36.556
"It does look warm and cozy," said Jemima.

7
00:00:36.557 --> 00:00:39.015
So Jemima went in.

8
00:00:39.016 --> 00:00:44.565
She gathered straw and feathers.

9
00:00:44.566 --> 00:00:51.155
Soon she had a nice, warm nest.

10
00:00:51.156 --> 00:00:55.440
"I'll be back tomorrow," she said.

11
00:00:55.441 --> 00:01:01.112
"I'll take care of your nest," said the fox.

12
00:01:01.113 --> 00:01:05.464
"You're so kind!" said Jemima.

13
00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:17.105
"Thank you."

14
00:01:17.106 --> 00:01:22.880
Each day Jemima came to the shed.

15
00:01:22.881 --> 00:01:27.052
She went inside and laid an egg.

16
00:01:27.053 --> 00:01:57.402
Then she went home in the evening.

17
00:01:57.403 --> 00:02:03.537
Each night the fox counted the eggs.

18
00:02:03.538 --> 00:02:07.033
He turned them over and smiled.

19
00:02:07.034 --> 00:02:10.931
"They're so big!" he said.

20
00:02:10.932 --> 00:02:18.065
"They look delicious!"

21
00:02:18.066 --> 00:02:25.240
At last nine eggs filled the nest.

22
00:02:25.241 --> 00:02:28.482
"I'm done," Jemima said.

23
00:02:28.483 --> 00:02:31.869
"I'll be back tomorrow.

24
00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:37.365
Then I'll stay until my eggs hatch."

25
00:02:37.366 --> 00:02:41.585
"Wonderful!" said the fox.

26
00:02:41.586 --> 00:02:44.873
He licked his lips.

27
00:02:44.874 --> 00:02:49.939
"Please bring some herbs tomorrow," he said.

28
00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:56.863
"I will cook a big dinner for us!"

